What is simulated?
==
This simulation is tuned to reproduce the figure 2 of Motta Schonert NIMA 539(2005) 217
It uses the material and detector definitions prefixed by Motta in common/data.
The script is vis-Motta.mac

How to use?
==
It works using directly the OMGsim binary (not the test)

./OMGsim -fa ../scripts/vis-Motta.mac
root -l default.root 
Hit->Draw ("acos(-VertexDirZ)/TMath::Pi()*180.>>h(90,0,90)","100");f = new TF1 ("f","5e6*TMath::Pi()/180.*sin(x*TMath::Pi()/180.)",0,90);h->Divide(f);h->Draw ()
The plot with absorption (Fig. 2. left) should be reproduced.

Additional comments
==
This repository shows how to use OMGsim in library mode only, including new user analysis and stepping action.
